{"kind":"assert","text":"Adopted: the scope and replay contract, revision 18 at be90ff05 (request 9626787f, hugh's canonical URI), approved by the checker (53c19783), reported delivered by builder (e4b8a96f) and ratified by the planner (59079b34). It defines the canonical artroom://\u003chost\u003e/\u003cscope id\u003e URI with its incarnation, fact and item forms, the normal form, three kinds of sameness, the mechanical mapping to the https routes, what a reader must not trust of a host, and label resolution (owner/repository#number) by two reads to a scope URI; revision 18 adds one reversible encoding for an item type in a URI and a fourth relation, the same selector, so two incarnation-free item links are never called the same reference. The two routes the mapping needs that do not yet exist are source rows for I3 or its successor. It succeeds adopted revision 16; revision 17 was replaced in review.","body":{"adoption":"scope-and-replay-contract-revision-18","approval":"53c19783","decides":"the canonical artroom:// URI for a scope, a fact and an item: grammar, normal form, sameness, mapping to the https routes, label resolution; one reversible encoding for an item type; a fourth relation, the same selector","head":"be90ff0527119800ded273cb8180e548a0710407","ratified":"59079b34","report":"e4b8a96f","supersedes":"revision 16 at 54420b41 (revision 17 replaced in review)"}}